		</header>
		<p class="chart-help"><b>How to read this:</b> each row is a year and each square is one week. Brighter squares had more fires. The bars on top show a typical week, and the bars on the right show each year's total.</p>
		<p id="calendar-readout" class="chart-readout"></p>
		<div class="chart-panel">
