			</button>
		</header>
		<p class="chart-help"><b>How to read this:</b> the orange line adds up fire days as the year goes on. The grey shading shows where past years landed. If orange is near the top, this year is worse than most.</p>
		<p id="race-readout" class="chart-readout"></p>
		<div class="chart-panel">
			<div id="race-chart" class="race-host" data-state="idle"></div>
			<div id="race-legend" class="ring-legend"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div id="drift-frame" class="chart-frame" hidden>
	<div class="chart-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="drift-frame-title">
		<header class="chart-head">
			<div>
				<p class="chart-eyebrow">Season shift · within 100 miles</p>
				<h2 id="drift-frame-title">Fire history</h2>
			</div>
			<button type="button" id="drift-frame-close" class="chart-close" aria-label="Close">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"></path></svg>
			</button>
		</header>
